{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Group 4 was one of six groups of national teams competing in the group stage of the [[1982 FIFA World Cup]]. Play began on 16 June and ended on 25 June 1982.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/82full.html |title=World Cup 1982 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref> The group consisted of four teams: Seeded team [[England national football team|England]], [[France national football team|France]], [[Czechoslovakia national football team|Czechoslovakia]] and World Cup debutants [[Kuwait national football team|Kuwait]].

England won the group after three successive victories and advanced to the second round, along with France.

